#. Used in the browser
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"CrowdSec resolves the AS and country itself, in the "
"{crowdsecurity_geoip_enrich} parser on the machine that raised the alert. "
"The LAPI never computes them, it stores whatever the agent sent. Install "
"that parser on the reporting machine and these alerts start carrying "
"{as_name}, {as_number} and {cn}."
msgstr ""
"CrowdSec bepaalt het AS en het land zelf, in de parser "
"{crowdsecurity_geoip_enrich} op de machine die de alert aanmaakte. De LAPI "
"berekent ze nooit, die slaat op wat de agent stuurde. Installeer die parser "
"op de meldende machine en deze alerts bevatten voortaan {as_name}, "
"{as_number} en {cn}."

#. Used in the browser
msgid ""
"CrowdSec returned as many alerts as the cap allows, so older ones are not "
"counted here. Raise CROWDSEC_ALERT_LIMIT, or the alert limit in Settings, to "
"see further back"
msgstr ""
"CrowdSec gaf zoveel alerts terug als de limiet toestaat, dus oudere worden "
"hier niet meegeteld. Verhoog CROWDSEC_ALERT_LIMIT, of de alertlimiet in "
"Instellingen, om verder terug te kijken"

